tly bright for most indoor environments, including well-lit corporate lobbies and meeting rooms.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How long does it take to install the 2x2 video wall setup?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is exceptionally fast, with a typical setup time under 2 hours, allowing you to unbox, mount, and start displaying content quickly without professional calibration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does this video wall require any configuration or calibration?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No, this product is pre-configured and requires zero additional configuration, making it a true plug & play solution.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty does the Plug & Play Video Wall come with?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It comes with a standard manufacturer warranty covering parts and support; please contact Brightluxx directly for detailed warranty terms and service options.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to custom-built video walls?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike custom solutions, the Plug & Play Video Wall offers quicker deployment with no configuration, ideal for projects with time constraints, though custom setups may offer more flexibility in size and design.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this video wall suitable for retail environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Its high resolution and brightness make it ideal for engaging customers with vibrant content in retail spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I use this video wall for corporate presentation rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, its sleek design and clear, sharp display make it perfect for meeting rooms and boardrooms, enhancing presentations and collaborative work