lay in under 2 hours.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Plug \\u0026amp; Play Video Wall 2x2 P1.5 offers an easy-turnkey solution featuring a pre-configured 2x2 layout with 1.5mm pixel pitch and 600 nits brightness. Designed for fast installation in under 2 hours, it is perfect for corporate lobbies, retail, and meeting rooms requiring vivid, high-resolution visuals with zero configuration needed.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the Plug \\u0026amp; Play Video Wall 2x2 P1.5?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe pixel pitch is 1.5mm, providing ultra-fine resolution perfect for close viewing distances in corporate and retail environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the video wall and is it suitable for well-lit spaces?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe display has a brightness of 600 nits, making it sufficiently bright for most indoor environments, including well-lit corporate lobbies and meeting rooms.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow long does it take to install the 2x2 video wall setup?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eInstallation is exceptionally fast, with a typical setup time under 2 hours, allowing you to unbox, mount, and start displaying content quickly without professional calibration.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDoes this video wall require any configuration or calibration?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eNo, this product is pre-configured and requires zero additional configuration, making it a true plug \\u0026amp; play solution.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Plug \\u0026 Play Video Wall 2x2 P1.5 | Brightluxx D