\", \"text\": \"The display has a brightness of 600 nits, making it sufficiently bright for most indoor environments, including well-lit corporate lobbies and meeting rooms.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How long does it take to install the 2x2 video wall setup?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is exceptionally fast, with a typical setup time under 2 hours, allowing you to unbox, mount, and start displaying content quickly without professional calibration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does this video wall require any configuration or calibration?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No, this product is pre-configured and requires zero additional configuration, making it a true plug & play solution.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty does the Plug & Play Video Wall come with?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It comes with a standard manufacturer warranty covering parts and support; please contact Brightluxx directly for detailed warranty terms and service options.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to custom-built video walls?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike custom solutions, the Plug & Play Video Wall offers quicker deployment with no configuration, ideal for projects with time constraints, though custom setups may offer more flexibility in size and design.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this video wall suitable for retail environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Its high resolution and brightness make it ideal for engaging customers with vibrant content in retail spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I use this video wall for corporate presentation rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, its sleek design and clear, sharp display make it perfect for meeting rooms and boardrooms, enhancing presentations and collaborative work.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Plug & Play Video Wall 2x2 P1.5\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/plug-play-videowall-2x2\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \