d.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the Plug &amp; Play Video Wall 2x2 P1.5?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 1.5mm, providing ultra-fine resolution perfect for close viewing distances in corporate and retail environments.</p><h3>How bright is the video wall and is it suitable for well-lit spaces?</h3><p>The display has a brightness of 600 nits, making it sufficiently bright for most indoor environments, including well-lit corporate lobbies and meeting rooms.</p><h3>How long does it take to install the 2x2 video wall setup?</h3><p>Installation is exceptionally fast, with a typical setup time under 2 hours, allowing you to unbox, mount, and start displaying content quickly without professional calibration.</p><h3>Does this video wall require any configuration or calibration?</h3><p>No, this product is pre-configured and requires zero additional configuration, making it a true plug &amp; play solution.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Plug & Play Video Wall 2x2 P1.5 | Brightluxx Dubai UAE\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Easy-install Plug & Play 2x2 Video Wall P1.5 for impactful displays in Dubai. Transform your space with Brightluxx in UAE now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/plug-play-videowall-2x2\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/plug-play-videowall-2x2\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleT